<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"You have truly worked hard, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
This is the final destination of this world. This is the truth that was hidden in this world."<PG>
"When I think of it, every incident came from wanting to protect someone dear―and because they wanted to protect them, they had no choice but to fall into wickedness. 
{PAUSE ""}
I believe they happened because of that."<PG>
"With a little more courage, if only someone had been able to help a little more―
{PAUSE ""}
surely none of the many incidents we have seen would have happened."<PG>
"<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, I am satisfied. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was able to learn why I took Natsumi's life."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"But the Natsumi of the world I was in will never come back. That is a fact that can no longer be changed."<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
